  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 545,
      "text": "It is they whom Allah has cursed, and whoever Allah curses, you will never find any helper for him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 5,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 87,
      "ruku": 69,
      "hizbQuarter": 34,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 546,
      "text": "Do they have a share in the dominion? Even if so, they would not give people even as much as the speck on a date stone.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 5,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 87,
      "ruku": 69,
      "hizbQuarter": 34,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 547,
      "text": "Or do they envy people for what Allah has given them[40] out of His bounty? We gave the descendants of Abraham the Book and wisdom[41], and We gave them great authority[42].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 5,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 87,
      "ruku": 69,
      "hizbQuarter": 34,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 548,
      "text": "Some of them believed in him [i.e., Muhammad], while others turned away from him. Hell is sufficient as a blaze.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 5,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 87,
      "ruku": 69,
      "hizbQuarter": 34,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 549,
      "text": "Those who reject Our verses, We will cast them into the Fire. Whenever their skins are burnt through, We will replace them with fresh skins, so that they may taste the punishment. Indeed, Allah is All-Mighty, All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 5,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 87,
      "ruku": 69,
      "hizbQuarter": 34,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 550,
      "text": "As for those who believe and do righteous deeds, We will admit them into gardens under which rivers flow, abiding therein forever. They will have therein pure spouses[43], and We will admit them into a cool refreshing shade.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 5,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 87,
      "ruku": 69,
      "hizbQuarter": 34,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 551,
      "text": "Indeed, Allah commands you to return trusts to their owners, and when you judge between people, judge with justice. What an excellent exhortation from Allah to you! Indeed, Allah is All-Hearing, All-Seeing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 5,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 87,
      "ruku": 69,
      "hizbQuarter": 35,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 552,
      "text": "O you who believe, obey Allah and obey the Messenger, and those of you who are in authority[44]. If you disagree over anything, refer it to Allah and the Messenger, if you believe in Allah and the Last Day; that is better and more commendable in the end.",
